  "markdown": "3173310\n\n**American Consular Service**\nat ...RIGA, LATVIA.\n\n**QUOTA**\n**Immigration Visa**\n\n- [ ] Nonpreference\n- [x] Preference\n\n- **Passport No.**: <sup>31014</sup>/<sub>585822</sub>, issued by Soviet\n\nauthorities, Kiev, Russia\n\non the 20th\n\nday of **December** , A. D. **1926** , valid until the **30th** day of **January** , A. D. **1928**\n\n<figure type=\"PHOTOGRAPH\">Black-and-white portrait photograph of an elderly woman with a light headscarf or cloth wrapped over her head, looking directly at the camera with a stern, weary expression and deep facial wrinkles. Her face fills the upper center of the frame, and her dark clothing is visible at the bottom. A handwritten name label in black ink on a white strip across the lower portion reads \"Basia × Chlourman\" with additional scribbled marks above and below the name. A partial circular stamp is visible in the upper right corner, and small printed text in the bottom right corner reads \"1-1096 Government Printing Office\".</figure>\n\nNo. 840\n\n- **Russian** (Quota.)  \n- **Russian** (Nationality.)\n\n- **Date**: February 2nd, 1927\n\nFor the journey to the United States.\n\n**SEEN:**\n\nThe Bearer, Basia CHTOURMAN (Ternoff Schturman) , who is of Russian nationality, having (Citizen or subject.) been seen and examined, is classified as a Quota Immigrant and is granted this Immigration Visa, pursuant to the Immigration Act of 1924.\n\nThe validity of this Immigration Visa expires on\n\nthe 2nd day of June\n\n[stamp: A.D. 1927 AMERICAN CONSULAR SERVICE FEE STAMP]\n[signature]\n\n[signature]\nVice Consul ........ of the\nUnited States of America,\n\nFee $9.00 [blank]\n\nFee No. ...\n\nNOTE: This Immigration Visa will not entitle the person to whom issued to enter the United States if upon arrival in the United States, he is found to be inadmissible to the United States under the Immigration Laws. (Subdivision (g), Section 2, Immigration Act of 1924.)\n\n* Check appropriate classification.\n\n[seal: illegible]\n\n<!-- doc_id=parse-01m7rwxdjka6nzy1bjbnj3wxsy -->",
